msgid ""
"The H743 and U575 memory regions are not one interchangeable DMA heap. "
"Consult their exact `soc.json` memory domains and DMA contracts. Likewise, "
"F407 CCM is not ordinary DMA-accessible SRAM; GD32F470 TCM likewise has a "
"separate reachability contract. The GD32F303 RC part deliberately avoids the "
"larger-density code/data Flash split; another density requires its own "
"geometry and executable-memory review."
msgstr ""
"H743 和 U575 的存储区域不能视为可互换的统一 DMA 堆。应查阅精确的 `soc.json` 存储域与 DMA 合同。同样，F407 CCM "
"不是普通的 DMA 可访问 SRAM；GD32F470 TCM 也有独立的可达性合同。GD32F303 选择 RC 型号，明确避开更大容量型号的代码/数据"
" Flash 分离；其他容量需要单独审查几何与可执行存储。"

msgid ""
"NUCLEO-F103RB wiring comes from UM1724 Rev 17: PA5 is D13/user LED LD2, and "
"USART2 PA2/PA3 reaches ST-LINK VCP with SB13/SB14 ON and SB62/SB63 OFF. These"
" are documented reference conditions, not observations of a connected board. "
"The HSI profile does not assume the board's optional HSE or ST-LINK MCO "
"arrangement. GD32F303 pin multiplexing is a chip route until a separately "
"sourced PCB authorizes the connection and electrical conditions."
msgstr ""
"NUCLEO-F103RB 接线来自 UM1724 Rev 17：PA5 对应 D13/用户 LED LD2；SB13/SB14 接通且 "
"SB62/SB63 断开时，USART2 PA2/PA3 连接 ST-LINK VCP。这些是文档参考条件，不是对已连接实板的观察。HSI "
"配置不假设板上可选 HSE 或 ST-LINK MCO 的设置。GD32F303 引脚复用仍属于芯片路线，直到独立来源的 PCB "
"资料授权对应连接和电气条件。"

