"stm32-provider.md)。F1、G4、H7 和 U5 不继承 F4 驱动资格。GD32 "
"库保持独立依赖。必须审查每个导入文件的许可证和硬件假设；寄存器相似不能证明这两个条件成立。"

msgid "What Zephyr contributes"
msgstr "借鉴 Zephyr 的内容"

msgid ""
"The reviewed comparison is [Zephyr v4.4.2](https://github.com/zephyrproject-"
"rtos/zephyr/tree/dccb09599635bdff17633fa7e9dab014b91dce90), commit "
"`dccb09599635bdff17633fa7e9dab014b91dce90`. Its [west "
"manifest](https://github.com/zephyrproject-"
"rtos/zephyr/blob/dccb09599635bdff17633fa7e9dab014b91dce90/west.yml) pins its "
"own HAL dependencies. It is a design reference, not another Nexus "
"configuration authority or an assertion that Zephyr supports every selected "
"part. In particular, GD32F3x0 and GD32F30x are different peripheral families."
msgstr ""
"本次审查比较采用 [Zephyr v4.4.2](https://github.com/zephyrproject-"
"rtos/zephyr/tree/dccb09599635bdff17633fa7e9dab014b91dce90)，提交为 "
"`dccb09599635bdff17633fa7e9dab014b91dce90`。其 [west "
"manifest](https://github.com/zephyrproject-"
"rtos/zephyr/blob/dccb09599635bdff17633fa7e9dab014b91dce90/west.yml)固定自身 HAL "
"依赖。它是设计参考，不是另一份 Nexus 配置权威，也不表示 Zephyr 支持所有选定料号。特别是 GD32F3x0 和 GD32F30x "
"是不同外设系列。"

msgid "Reviewed upstream pattern"
msgstr "受审上游模式"

msgid "Nexus application and limit"
msgstr "Nexus 应用与限制"

